{title: Kis Tarah Shukar Tera}
{artist: Arijit Singh}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Kis [D]tarah se [G]shukar tera,        Ab [A]ada karu [D]main
Kis [D]tarah se [G]shukar tera,        Ab [A]ada karu [D]main
Is [D]mohobbat ka [G]harjana,        Kis [A]tarah bharu [D]main
[G]Khaamosh reh kar bhi [A]keh gaye,        [F#]Dariya sa dil tak [Bm]beh gaye
Tum [G]par ho raha hai [Em]pura [A]aitbaar,        Tum [D]hi ho hifaazat [G]meri suno
Ye [A]kaha hai rooh [D]ne,        Kis [D]tarah se [G]shukar tera
Ab [A]ada karu [D]main,        [D]Ishq ka bas naam liya
Maine [G]samjha nahi tha [D]ise,        [D]Tune sikhaaya ki ye hai ibaadat
[G]Rooh ki bhaasha hai [A]yeh,        Teri [G]badaulat paayi woh [A]daulat
Jo [Em]mili na mujhko [D]kahin,        [G]Jazbaat hadd se [A]badhne lage
[F#]Dene lage [Bm]sadaa tujhe,        Har [G]pal hai zaruri [Em]ab tera [A]deedar
Kis [D]tarah se [G]shukar tera,        Ab [A]ada karu [D]main
Is [D]mohobbat ka [G]harjana,        Kis [A]tarah bharu [D]main
Aisa [A]kabhi dekha [G]nahi,        Na [Em]kabhi bhi kahin [D]suna
Dene [A]wala sab dekar [G]bhi,        Keh [Em]raha hai [D]shukriya
[G]Tune hi toh [A]samjha mujhe,        Jo na [F#]keh saka main, [Bm]suna tumhe
[G]Ehsan ye tera [Em]na bhalunga [A]sadaa,        Kis [D]tarah se [G]shukar tera
Ab [A]ada karu [D]main,        Is [D]mohobbat ka [G]harjana
Kis [A]tarah bharu [D]main
